  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 34 * 58 * 2 * 96 * 4 = 29\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) −, ÷, +, ÷\n\n34 * 58 * 2 * 96 * 4 = 29 ⇒34 - 58 ÷ 2 + 96 ÷ 4 = 29\n\n⇒34 - __**58 ÷ 2**__ + __**96 ÷ 4**__ = 29\n\n⇒__**34 + 24**__ - 29 = 29\n\n⇒__58** - 29**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 29 = 29 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 2) ×, ÷, +, −\n\n34 * 58 * 2 * 96 * 4 = 29 ⇒34 × 58 ÷ 2 + 96 - 4 = 29\n\n⇒34 × __**58 **____**÷**____** 2**__ + 96 - 4 = 29\n\n⇒__**34 × 29**__ + 96 - 4 = 29\n\n⇒__**986**____** **____**+ 96**__ - 4 = 29\n\n⇒**__1082__**__** - 4**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 1078 ≠ 29 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) +, ×, −, ÷\n\n34 * 58 * 2 * 96 * 4 = 29 ⇒34 + 58 × 2 - 96 ÷ 4 = 29\n\n⇒34 + 58 × 2 - __**96 **____**÷**____** 4**__ = 29\n\n⇒34 + __**58 **____**×**____** 2**__ - 24 = 29\n\n⇒__**34 + 116**__ - 24 = 29\n\n⇒__150____** - 2**____**4**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 126 ≠ 29 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) ÷, ×, +, −\n\n34 * 58 * 2 * 96 * 4 = 29 ⇒34 ÷ 58 × 2 + 96 - 4 = 29\n\n⇒__**34 ÷**____** 58**__ × 2 + 96 - 4 = 29\n\n⇒__**0.5**____** ×**____** 2**__ + 96 - 4 = 29\n\n⇒__**1**____** + 96**__ - 4 = 29\n\n⇒__97** - 4**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 93 ≠ 29 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
